<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady/firm - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady/firm - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady-firm. Demand and movement were moderate. Top $59.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>				   Country:		     Plants:</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 LBS.   56.50-58.00 Few 58.50	57.50-59.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 LBS.   52.00-56.50</p>
<p>	  210-230 LBS.   47.00-52.00</p>
<p>Sows:  Mostly Steady. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-500 lbs.   42.00-44.50 Few 41.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs.   44.50-47.00</p>
<p>   Few over 600 lbs.   47.00-48.00</p>
